# A short tour as a GIF: connections, search, an approval request, the history.
Output "docs/screenshots/tour.gif"
Source "docs/tapes/config.tape"
Set Framerate 12
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "tussh-demo" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 1.5s
Down@600ms 3
Sleep 1s
Type "/"
Sleep 300ms
Type@150ms "home"
Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Type "3"
Sleep 2.5s
Down
Sleep 2.5s
Type "4"
Sleep 1s
Down@500ms 4
Sleep 2.5s
